        "text": "Discusses, in Spanish, stewardship and financing, giving high priority to mobilizing international and national resources to strengthen health systems and buy HPV vaccines as part of a comprehensive multi-partner strategy. It notes that national decisions should consider benefits not captured in health and cost analyses.",
